# A delivery in the owner's mail: a line on the day it comes. Its trigger
# (delivery-today) lists the parcels coming today; each is said once.
workflow delivery
subject errands
about A delivery in your mail: a line on the day it comes.
start trigger:delivery-today
tag no
limits steps 3, days 1

step tell
say Delivery today: {event.subject} ({event.from}).
end
